
========================================================================================
EXACT-PERIOD EULER-COPY UNIT PACKETS
========================================================================================
For q divisible by 7, exact-period packets whose denominator touches 7 are uniformly distributed over F_7^*.  This is the copy ledger; any QR/NQR split must come from a later character phase, not from raw phi mass.
    q   phi(q)  top per unit  full-mask mass  full per unit 7-touch per unit
   14        6             1               0              0                2
  210       48             8              48              8               30
 1260      288            48             576             96              180

For q=1260, the exact top-period unit seam has 48 copies per unit residue, while the full {2,3,5,7} squarefree mask has 96 per unit residue.  Both are uniform on F_7^*.

